     "code": "obs = observe()\nholder = obs[\"zones\"][\"magenta_holder\"]\ntable_z = obs[\"table_z\"]\n\n# Pick up the pen\ncandidates = grasp_candidates(\"red_pen\")\n# Choose a grasp near the middle / suitable squeeze width\nbest_cand = min(candidates, key=lambda c: abs(c[\"squeeze_width\"] - 0.012))\ngrasp(best_cand)\n\n# Move above the pen holder, sufficiently high to clear the rim\nrim_z = table_z + holder[\"rim_height\"]\nhx, hy = holder[\"center\"][0], holder[\"center\"][1]\ncarry_to(hx, hy, height=holder[\"rim_height\"] + 0.15)\n\n# Orient gripper to tilt/insert pen upright, or re-orient:\n# When grasped horizontally top-down, the pen lies along the 'side' axis.\n# To make it upright (vertical), approach can point horizontally, or rotate gripper.\n# Let's inspect gripper orientation:\n# With approach=[0, 0, -1] and fingers squeezing across short axis, pen is along side = approach x finger_axis.\n# Turning gripper so approach is horizontal tilts the pen towards vertical.\n# Specifically, approach=[1, 0, 0] or [0, 1, 0] with finger_axis=[0, 0, 1] puts side along [0, 1, 0] or [-1, 0, 0]...\n# If finger_axis is along the pen's length? No, fingers squeeze the pen's width.\n# If fingers squeeze across the pen, the pen is along side vector.\n# To make side=[0, 0, 1] (pen pointing up/down), we need approach x finger_axis = [0, 0, 1].\n# For example, approach=[1, 0, 0], finger_axis=[0, 1, 0] -> side = [0, 0, 1]!\n# Let's test reachability of approach=[0, -1, 0], finger_axis=[1, 0, 0] -> side = [0, 0, 1].\ntarget_z = rim_z + 0.08\napproach_vec = [1.0, 0.0, 0.0]\nfinger_axis_vec = [0.0, 1.0, 0.0]\n\nik = solve_ik(hx, hy, target_z, approach=approach_vec, finger_axis=finger_axis_vec)\nif not ik[\"reachable\"]:\n    approach_vec = [0.0, 1.0, 0.0]\n    finger_axis_vec = [-1.0, 0.0, 0.0]\n\nmove_gripper(hx, hy, target_z, approach=approach_vec, finger_axis=finger_axis_vec, path=\"joint\")\n\n# Lower down into the holder\nmove_by(dz=-0.04)\nopen_gripper()\nretreat(0.15)\ngo_home()\ncheck(\"red_pen\", \"magenta_holder\")",
